/E (The project presents a modular, multi-modal framework for web application analysis and quality engineering. It combines bounded crawling with comprehensive structural, operational, and visual data collection, while integrated vision and language components handle graphical interface detection, text recognition, and semantic interpretation to generate structured visual evidence. This fused evidence directly supports defect analysis, test generation, validation, and reporting. Furthermore, the modular architecture ensures high scalability, easier debugging, seamless component replacement, and flexible hardware execution.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
